  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.61,
      401.85,
      240.95
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO ENABLE SPECIAL LEGAL PROVISIONS TO BE MADE IN RESPECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      242.57,
      401.73,
      253.91
    ],
    "text": "OF PERSONS WHO WERE UNABLE TO PURSUE THEIR RIGHTS IN COURT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      255.65,
      401.85,
      266.99
    ],
    "text": "FOR THE RECOVERY OF ANY IMMOVABLE PROPERTY INCLUDING LAND",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      268.61,
      401.85,
      279.95
    ],
    "text": "DUE TO THE ACTIVITIES OF A MILITANT TERRORIST GROUP WHICH",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      281.57,
      401.85,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "PREVAILED IN SRI LANKA AND FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      294.65,
      254.85,
      305.99
    ],
    "text": "OR INCIDENTAL THERETO",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      320.57,
      401.91,
      396.95
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS certain persons have been disadvantaged andtherefore unable to pursue their rights in court for therecovery of any immovable property including land due tothe activities of a militant terrorist group during the periodcommencing on May 1st 1983 and ending on May 18th2009:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      411.65,
      401.85,
      448.91
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS it has now become necessary to enactspecial legal provisions to enable such persons to pursuetheir rights in court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      463.61,
      401.9,
      487.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      502.61,
      401.75,
      526.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Prescription (SpecialProvisions) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      541.61,
      401.88,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) If at the time, when the right of any person to suefor the recovery of any immovable property including landshall have accrued, such person was a disadvantaged person,possession of the aforesaid immovable property includingland by any other person shall not be taken as giving suchother person any entitlement specified in section 3 of thePrescription Ordinance (Chapter 68) to such immovableproperty including land by virtue of such possession, solong as the first mentioned person remained a disadvantagedperson.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      321.55,
      443.14,
      330.62
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      543.19,
      455.85,
      619.46
    ],
    "text": "Right to sueforimmovablepropertyincludingland of adisadvantagedperson.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      167.17,
      345.08,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "Prescription (Special Provisions)2",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      203.17,
      221.59,
      214.24
    ],
    "text": "Illustration :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      226.97,
      397.17,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "\u2018A\u2019 is a disadvantaged person at the time \u2018B\u2019commences to possess \u2018A\u2019s land \u2013 Prescription willnot begin to run against \u2018A\u2019 as long as \u2018A\u2019 continuedto be a disadvantaged person.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      286.97,
      397.24,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in section13 of the Prescription Ordinance (Chapter 68), the adverseand undisturbed possession for thirty years of any immovableproperty including land by any person claiming the same,or by those under whom he claims, shall not be taken asconclusive proof of title in the manner provided for bysection 3 of the Prescription Ordinance (Chapter 68), wherethe person against whom the adverse and undisturbedpossession is being claimed was a disadvantaged person.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      406.97,
      397.19,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "3.For the avoidance of doubt, it is hereby declared thatif a disadvantaged person dies, the period during which hewas so disadvantaged shall inure to the benefit of his heiror heirs and accordingly such heir or heirs shall be entitledto the benefit granted to a disadvantaged person undersection 2 of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      490.97,
      397.22,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "4.A disadvantaged person who was unable to pursuehis rights for the recovery of any immovable propertyincluding land, shall be entitled to institute an action toavail himself of the benefits conferred by this Act withintwelve months after the coming into operation of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      610.97,
      397.16,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "5.The provisions of this Act shall not apply to or inrespect of any land which has been granted under theprovisions of the Land Development Ordinance (Chapter464), the Land Grants (Special Provisions) Act, No. 43 of1979, or the State Lands Ordinance (Chapter 454).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      145.87,
      263.45,
      150.87,
      274.79
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
