  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      202.97,
      243.69,
      214.31
    ],
    "text": "6.In this Act\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      203.85,
      226.97,
      401.91,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cactivities of any militant terrorist group\u201d meansany act which is defined as a \u201cterrorist act\u201d inthe Convention on the Suppression ofTerrorist Financing Act, No. 25 of 2005;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      203.85,
      286.97,
      401.9,
      382.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201cdisadvantaged person\u201d means a person who wasunable to pursue his rights in a court in whichhe was by law enabled to pursue such rights,as a result of the circumstances whichprevailed due to the activities of any militantterrorist group during the period commencingon May 1st 1983 and ending on May 18th2009.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      395.45,
      401.9,
      419.03
    ],
    "text": "7.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
